# Canonical author identities.
#
# Commits made from the CSCS login nodes picked up a per-node hostname as the
# email domain, so a single person appears as a dozen contributors in
# `git shortlog`, `git blame` and anything built on them. Mapping them here
# collapses those back to one identity without rewriting any history.
#
# Format: Canonical Name <canonical@email> Commit Name <commit@email>
#
# Note: GitHub's own contributor graph does not read .mailmap -- it links
# commits to accounts by the email recorded in each commit. This affects local
# git tooling only.

Samuel A. Cruz Alegría <cruzas@usi.ch> Samuel Cruz <cruzas@users.noreply.github.com>
